{"body": [{"y0": 67.1, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 277.8, "text": "passer, deliciae meae puellae,"}, {"y0": 84.9, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 299.4, "text": "quem plüs illa oculis suis amábat;"}, {"y0": 103.2, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 294.8, "text": "nam mellitus erat suamque norat"}, {"y0": 121.2, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 316.0, "text": "ipsam tam bene quam puella matrem,"}, {"y0": 139.6, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 410.7, "text": "nec sesé à gremio illius movébat, 95"}, {"y0": 157.8, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 316.4, "text": "sed circumsiliéns modo hüc modo illüc"}, {"y0": 175.8, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 303.8, "text": "ad solam dominam üsque pipiabat."}, {"y0": 194.0, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 295.8, "text": "Qui nunc it per iter tenebricosum"}, {"y0": 212.5, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 307.0, "text": "illüc unde negant redire quemquam."}, {"y0": 230.9, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 414.8, "text": "At vobis male sit, malae tenebrae 100"}, {"y0": 248.9, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 298.4, "text": "Ora, quae omnia bella devoratis:"}, {"y0": 266.9, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 313.1, "text": "tam bellum mihi passerem abstulistis."}, {"y0": 283.4, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 298.9, "text": "Ó factum male! O miselle passer!"}, {"y0": 303.6, "x0": 151.3, "x1": 278.2, "text": "Tuà nunc operà meae puellae"}, {"y0": 321.6, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 413.9, "text": "flendo turgiduli rubent ocell! 105"}, {"y0": 339.9, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 394.5, "text": "*His versibus ultimis poéta veram rationem doloris"}, {"y0": 357.9, "x0": 139.6, "x1": 394.5, "text": "sui reddit: quod oculi Lesbiae lacrimis turgidi erant ac"}, {"y0": 376.3, "x0": 139.6, "x1": 394.7, "text": "rubentes! Tunc enim Catullus Lesbiam sólam amabat"}, {"y0": 394.7, "x0": 139.4, "x1": 394.7, "text": "atque amorem suum perpetuum fore crédébat. Ecce"}, {"y0": 412.5, "x0": 139.4, "x1": 413.9, "text": "aliud carmen quó méns poétae amore accensa demons- 110"}, {"y0": 431.7, "x0": 139.4, "x1": 168.4, "text": "tratur:"}, {"y0": 449.4, "x0": 151.3, "x1": 318.7, "text": "Vivamus, mea Lesbia, atque amemus,"}, {"y0": 467.9, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 279.5, "text": "rümórésque senum severiorum"}, {"y0": 485.7, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 282.7, "text": "omnes unius aestimemus assis!"}, {"y0": 503.6, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 413.0, "text": "Soles occidere et redire possunt — 115"}, {"y0": 521.9, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 304.1, "text": "nobis, cum semel occidit. brevis lüx,"}, {"y0": 540.6, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 293.3, "text": "nox est perpetua üna dormienda."}], "margin": [{"y0": 69.2, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 77.3, "text": "[Catullus 3]"}, {"y0": 96.2, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 121.3, "text": "mellitus -a -um (« mel)"}, {"y0": 105.4, "x0": 43.7, "x1": 102.4, "text": "- dulcis (ut mel)"}, {"y0": 114.9, "x0": 38.6, "x1": 93.7, "text": "nórat — noverat"}, {"y0": 123.6, "x0": 38.6, "x1": 127.0, "text": "ipse m — dominus; ipsa f"}, {"y0": 132.8, "x0": 43.3, "x1": 124.7, "text": "— domina: suam ipsam"}, {"y0": 160.1, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 115.7, "text": "circum-silire « -salire"}, {"y0": 169.7, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 95.9, "text": "üsque — semper"}, {"y0": 178.1, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 115.3, "text": "pipiare — 'pipi' facere"}, {"y0": 187.5, "x0": 42.6, "x1": 70.5, "text": "(ut avis)"}, {"y0": 196.5, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 125.2, "text": "tenebricósus -a -um («te-"}, {"y0": 205.7, "x0": 42.2, "x1": 111.5, "text": "nebrae) — obscürus"}, {"y0": 215.0, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 126.8, "text": "negant redire quemquam"}, {"y0": 224.0, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 112.3, "text": "— dicunt *néminem"}, {"y0": 233.0, "x0": 42.1, "x1": 65.1, "text": "redire"}, {"y0": 249.6, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 127.4, "text": "Orcus -i m- Plüto : Inferi"}, {"y0": 259.5, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 104.9, "text": "dé-voràare — voràre"}, {"y0": 286.8, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 116.8, "text": "male factum — malefi-"}, {"y0": 296.0, "x0": 43.3, "x1": 60.8, "text": "cium"}, {"y0": 305.9, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 113.5, "text": "tua opera — tuà causá"}, {"y0": 314.2, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 114.6, "text": "turgidulus — turgidus"}, {"y0": 323.4, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 117.5, "text": "ocellus -17 — (parvus)"}, {"y0": 332.4, "x0": 42.1, "x1": 64.7, "text": "oculu